<title>AUSTRALIA: Atkins Carlyle year net profit A$7.76 mln.</title>
<headline>Atkins Carlyle year net profit A$7.76 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to May 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    14.14 vs 12.80</p>
<p>    Net					7.76 vs 7.50</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     14.0 vs 14.0</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     22.0 vs 22.0</p>
<p>    Sales				  342.34 vs 315.85</p>
<p>    Other income			   2.65 vs 3.69</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   25.29 vs 25.02</p>
<p>NOTE: Atkins Carlyle Ltd is an automotive parts and industrial supplies distributor.</p>
